"""
add_examples.py - Add Examples sections to SOP files after Troubleshooting section..

This script processes SOP markdown files and inserts an Examples section  
after the Troubleshooting section with sample inputs/outputs relevant to  
that SOP type. It handles various header levels (###, ####) and fixes  
syntax errors.
"""

